COMMENT ON TABLE "location_snapshot" IS '[module location, owner A06] Location used for one request or job, copied so later profile edits do not change history; frozen once confirmed or referenced (trigger) (BP §21, §66 Location Snapshot; PROF-ADDR-002; LOC-GEO-004).';
